WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.030
Night, on a dark common,
just after the Heat-Ray.

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:11.250
A lone man tells us: "Suddenly, like a thing
falling upon me from without, came—fear."

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.720
And he runs.

4
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:15.310
Later, he raises a glass at dinner.

5
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.630
Then he wades into a
river while others flee.

6
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.650
At the end, he sits alone, writing.

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.490
A scale tips one way, then the other.

8
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.930
Hero or coward: what kind of
man is telling this story?

9
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.280
In this mission, you'll meet him properly:

10
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.870
unnamed, married, a
writer living near Woking.

11
00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:38.780
You'll track how his moods and
conduct shift as the novel goes on.

12
00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:43.030
And you'll read what he confesses,
and decide what it does to your view.

13
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.160
Your mission: decide what kind
of man is telling this story.
